sk semantics during model-to-Gemara transformation.\"},\"Title\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Gemara Exporter Security\"}}},\"traceability\":{\"kind\":\"object\",\"object\":{\"Narrative\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Carries control-to-threat mappings and verification evidence into the Gemara evaluation and audit logs.\"},\"Title\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Gemara Exporter Traceability\"}}}}}}},{\"namespace\":\"engineering\",\"type\":\"engineering.catalog.functional_units\",\"target\":\"FU-GEMARA-EXPORTER\",\"properties\":{\"Aliases\":{\"kind\":\"list\",\"list\":[{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"enggemara\"}]},\"Definition\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Renders the model into OpenSSF Gemara L1-L7 catalogs and logs plus an optional OSCAL bridge, validated by the Gemara SDK.\"},\"ID\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"FU-GEMARA-EXPORTER\"},\"Name\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"gemara exporter\"}}}],\"extensionNamespace\":\"engineering\",\"extension\":\"engineering.functional_unit\"},{\"id\":\"FU-LOBSTER-EXPORTER\",\"name\":\"LOBSTER Exporter\",\"kind\":\"part_usage\",\"metaclass\":\"SysML::PartUsage\",\"properties\":{\"declaredName\":{\"values\":[{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"LOBSTER Exporter\"}]},\"elementId\":{\"values\":[{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"FU-LOBSTER-EXPORTER\"}]},\"owner\":{\"values\":[{\"kind\":\"reference\",\"reference\":\"FG-TRACEABILITY-COMPLIANCE\"}],\"derived\":true},\"owningNamespace\":{\"values\":[{\"kind\":\"reference\",\"reference\":\"engineering-model-go\"}],\"derived\":true}},\"namespace\":\"engineering-model-go\",\"owner\":\"FG-TRACEABILITY-COMPLIANCE\",\"metadata\":[{\"namespace\":\"engineering\",\"type\":\"engineering.functional_unit\",\"target\":\"FU-LOBSTER-EXPORTER\",\"properties\":{\"Group\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"FG-TRACEABILITY-COMPLIANCE\"},\"ID\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"FU-LOBSTER-EXPORTER\"},\"Name\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"LOBSTER Exporter\"},\"Prose\":{\"kind\"