del into SysML v2 without introducing a parallel authoring vocabulary.\"},\"Title\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"SysML Exporter Intent\"}}},\"communication\":{\"kind\":\"object\",\"object\":{\"Narrative\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Resolves standard SysML and KerML concepts through one mapping registry and exposes engineering-specific concepts as typed extensions.\"},\"Title\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"SysML Exporter Communication\"}}},\"deployment\":{\"kind\":\"object\",\"object\":{\"Narrative\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Runs through engsysml locally and in CI with deterministic textual and project interchange outputs.\"},\"Title\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"SysML Exporter Deployment\"}}},\"security\":{\"kind\":\"object\",\"object\":{\"Narrative\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Rejects unknown, duplicate, and lossy mappings before publishing an artifact with a conformance claim.\"},\"Title\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"SysML Exporter Security\"}}},\"traceability\":{\"kind\":\"object\",\"object\":{\"Narrative\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Preserves stable Engineering Model identifiers and emits executable coverage evidence for every mapped concept.\"},\"Title\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"SysML Exporter Traceability\"}}}}}}},{\"namespace\":\"engineering\",\"type\":\"engineering.catalog.functional_units\",\"target\":\"FU-SYSML-EXPORTER\",\"properties\":{\"Aliases\":{\"kind\":\"list\",\"list\":[{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"engsysml\"}]},\"Definition\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Generates SysML v2 model artifacts from the canonical semantic model and reports conformance coverage.\"},\"ID\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"FU-SYSML-EXPORTER\"},\"Name\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"sysml exporter\"}}}],\"extensionNamespace\":\"engineering\",\"extension\":\"engineering.functional_unit\"},{\"id\":\"FU-SYSTEM-COMPOSITION\",\"name\":\"System Composition\",\"kind\":\"part_usage\",\"metaclass\":\"SysML::PartUsage\",\"properties\":{\"declaredName\":{\"values\":[{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"System Composition\"}]},\"elementId\":{\"values\":[{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"FU-SYSTEM-COMPOSITION\"}]},\"owner\":{\"values\":[{\"kind\":\"reference\",\"reference\":\"FG-MODEL-AUTHORING\"}],\"derived\":true},\"owningNamespace\":{\"values\":[{\"kind\":\"reference\",\"reference\":\"engineering-model-go\"}],\"derived\":true}},\"namespace\":\"engineering-model-go\",\"owner\":\"FG-MODEL-AUTHORING\",\"metadata\":[{\"namespace\":\"engineering\",\"type\":\"engineering.functional_unit\",\"target\":\"FU-SYSTEM-COMPOSITION\",\"properties\":{\"Group\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"FG-MODEL-AUTHORING\"},\"ID\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"FU-SYSTEM-COMPOSITION\"},\"Name\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"System Composition\"},\"Prose\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Resolves downward subsystem references from local subdirectories or external git repositories cloned into the .engmod/subsystems cache, and composes a federated system-of-systems model.\"},\"Tags\":{\"kind\":\"null\"}}},{\"namespace\":\"engineering\",\"type\":\"engineering.design_functional_unit\",\"target\":\"FU-SYSTEM-COMPOSITION\",\"properties\":{\"Group\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"FG-MODEL-AUTHORING\"},\"ID\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"FU-SYSTEM-COMPOSITION\"},\"Views\":{\"kind\":\"object\",\"object\":{\"architecture_intent\":{\"kind\":\"object\",\"object\":{\"Narrative\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Resolves a parent model's downward subsystem references into a federated system-of-systems, from local subdirectories or external git repositories.\"},\"Title\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"System Composition Intent\"}}},\"communication\":{\"kind\":\"object\",\"object\":{\"Narrative\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Binds each subsystem's provides/requires contract to the parent's allocations and satisfactions without modifying the subsystem.\"},\"Title\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"System Composition Communication\"}}},\"deployment\":{\"kind\":\"object\",\"object\":{\"Narrative\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"External git subsystems are cloned once into the gitignored .engmod/subsystems cache and reused offline.\"},\"Title\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"System Composition Deployment\"}}},\"security\":{\"kind\":\"object\",\"object\":{\"Narrative\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Enforces a workspace boundary and rejects references that escape it or form a cycle.\"},\"Title\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"System Composition Security\"}}},\"traceability\":{\"kind\":\"object\",\"object\":{\"Narrative\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Reports cycle, out-of-workspace, missing-ref, clone-failed, and unsatisfied-require diagnostics for every subsystem reference.\"},\"Title\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"System Composition Traceability\"}}}}}}},{\"namespace\":\"engineering\",\"type\":\"engineering.catalog.functional_units\",\"target\":\"FU-SYSTEM-COMPOSITION\",\"properties\":{\"Aliases\":{\"kind\":\"list\",\"list\":[{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"composition\"}]},\"Definition\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Resolves downward subsystem references from local subdirectories or external git repositories and composes a federated system-of-systems model.\"},\"ID\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"FU-SYSTEM-COMPOSITION\"},\"Name\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"system composition\"}}}],\"extensionNamespace\":\"engineering\",\"extension\":\"engineering.functional_unit\"},{\"id\":\"FU-THREAT-EXPORTER\",\"name\":\"Threat Exporter\",\"kind\":\"part_usage\",\"metaclass\":\"SysML::PartUsage\",\"properties\":{\"declaredName\":{\"values\":[{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Threat Exporter\"}]},\"elementId\":{\"values\":[{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"FU-THREAT-EXPORTER\"}]},\"owner\":{\"values\":[{\"kind\":\"reference\",\"reference\":\"FG-ARTIFACT-GENERATION\"}],\"derived\":true},\"owningNamespace\":{\"values\":[{\"kind\"