en generation run is requested, the engineering model go shall generate deterministic naf v4.1 architecture document from referenced canonical model views.\"}}}],\"extensionNamespace\":\"engineering\",\"extension\":\"engineering.requirement_source\"},{\"id\":\"REQ-EMG-043\",\"name\":\"REQ-EMG-043\",\"kind\":\"requirement_definition\",\"metaclass\":\"SysML::RequirementDefinition\",\"properties\":{\"declaredName\":{\"values\":[{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"REQ-EMG-043\"}]},\"elementId\":{\"values\":[{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"REQ-EMG-043\"}]},\"owner\":{\"values\":[{\"kind\":\"reference\",\"reference\":\"engineering-model-go\"}],\"derived\":true},\"owningNamespace\":{\"values\":[{\"kind\":\"reference\",\"reference\":\"engineering-model-go\"}],\"derived\":true}},\"namespace\":\"engineering-model-go\",\"owner\":\"engineering-model-go\",\"features\":[{\"name\":\"text\",\"kind\":\"attribute\",\"type\":\"String\",\"value\":{\"language\":\"literal\",\"value\":\"While ci validation mode is active, when generation run is requested, the engineering model go shall reject unsupported naf version plus unknown viewpoint code plus dangling profile reference before artifact generated event is raised.\"}},{\"name\":\"notes\",\"kind\":\"attribute\",\"type\":\"String\",\"value\":{\"language\":\"literal\",\"value\":\"Validation covers stakeholder actor bindings, concern ownership, architecture-product concern references, and Engmod view references.\"}}],\"metadata\":[{\"namespace\":\"engineering\",\"type\":\"engineering.requirement_source\",\"target\":\"REQ-EMG-043\",\"properties\":{\"AppliesTo\":{\"kind\":\"list\",\"list\":[{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"FU-VALIDATION-ENGINE\"},{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"FU-NAF-EXPORTER\"},{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"FU-CLI-ORCHESTRATION\"}]},\"ID\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"REQ-EMG-043\"},\"Notes\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Validation covers stakeholder actor bindings, concern ownership, architecture-product 