ent contracts for catalog, architecture, requirements, and design files.\\n\"},\"Title\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Model Authoring Architecture Intent\"}}},\"communication\":{\"kind\":\"object\",\"object\":{\"Narrative\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Model Authoring coordinates loading and command entrypoints so downstream generation and validation receive normalized inputs.\\n\"},\"Title\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Model Authoring Communication\"}}},\"deployment\":{\"kind\":\"object\",\"object\":{\"Narrative\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Model Authoring is deployed as CLI and package boundaries that can evolve without disrupting validation and export engines.\\n\"},\"Title\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Model Authoring Deployment\"}}},\"security\":{\"kind\":\"object\",\"object\":{\"Narrative\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Model Authoring enforces input sanity and reference consistency to reduce malformed model ingestion risk.\\n\"},\"Title\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Model Authoring Security\"}}},\"traceability\":{\"kind\":\"object\",\"object\":{\"Narrative\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Model Authoring maintains stable IDs that anchor requirement and ownership traces across generated artifacts.\\n\"},\"Title\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Model Authoring Traceability\"}}}}}}},{\"kind\":\"object\",\"object\":{\"ID\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"FG-VALIDATION-ANALYSIS\"},\"Views\":{\"kind\":\"object\",\"object\":{\"architecture_intent\":{\"kind\":\"object\",\"object\":{\"Narrative\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Validation and Analysis preserves model correctness and derives implementation evidence from repository artifacts.\\n\"},\"Title\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Validation and Analysis Architecture Intent\"}}},\"communication\":{\"kind\":\"object\",\"object\":{\"Narrative\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Validation and Analysis exchanges diagnostics and inferred evidence with generation and MCP surfaces.\\n\"},\"Title\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Validation and Analysis Communication\"}}},\"deployment\":{\"kind\":\"object\",\"object\":{\"Narrative\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Validation and Analysis ships as shared libraries consumed by CLIs and server workflows.\\n\"},\"Title\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Validation and Analysis Deployment\"}}},\"security\":{\"kind\":\"object\",\"object\":{\"Narrative\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Validation and Analysis defends against ambiguous references and stale traces through strict checks.\\n\"},\"Title\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Validation and Analysis Security\"}}},\"traceability\":{\"kind\":\"object\",\"object\":{\"Narrative\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Validation and Analysis links requirements to code/runtime/test evidence for impact-oriented planning.\\n\"},\"Title\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Validation and Analysis Traceability\"}}}}}}},{\"kind\":\"object\",\"object\":{\"ID\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"FG-ARTIFACT-GENERATION\"},\"Views\":{\"kind\":\"object\",\"object\":{\"architecture_intent\":{\"kind\":\"object\",\"object\":{\"Narrative\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Artifact Generation turns modeled intent into publication and exchange outputs used by engineers and tools.\\n\"},\"Title\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Artifact Generation Architecture Intent\"}}},\"communication\":{\"kind\":\"object\",\"object\":{\"Narrative\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Artifact Generation coordinates projections, templates, and exporters while preserving stable output contracts.\\n\"},\"Title\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Artifact Generation Communication\"}}},\"deployment\":{\"kind\":\"object\",\"object\":{\"Narrative\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Artifact Generation runs in local and CI contexts with deterministic output expectations.\\n\"},\"Title\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Artifact Generation Deployment\"}}},\"security\":{\"kind\":\"object\",\"object\":{\"Narrative\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Artifact Generation validates output schema boundaries before publishing external artifacts.\\n\"},\"Title\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Artifact Generation Security\"}}},\"traceability\":{\"kind\":\"object\",\"object\":{\"Narrative\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Artifact Generation carries stable IDs and evidence references into AI, docs, and exchange formats.\\n\"},\"Title\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Artifact Generation Traceability\"}}}}}}},{\"kind\":\"object\",\"object\":{\"ID\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"FG-TRACEABILITY-COMPLIANCE\"},\"Views\":{\"kind\":\"object\",\"object\":{\"architecture_intent\":{\"kind\":\"object\",\"object\":{\"Narrative\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Traceability and Compliance ensures requirement lineage and assurance artifacts remain verifiable.\\n\"},\"Title\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Traceability and Compliance Architecture Intent\"}}},\"communication\":{\"kind\":\"object\",\"object\":{\"Narrative\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Traceability and Compliance integrates requirement, test, and report surfaces through shared ID contracts.\\n\"},\"Title\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Traceability and Compliance Communication\"}}},\"deployment\":{\"kind\":\"object\",\"object\":{\"Narrative\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Traceability and Compliance components execute in export pipelines and are validated against external toolchains.\\n\"},\"Title\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Traceability and Compliance Deployment\"}}},\"security\":{\"kind\":\"object\",\"object\":{\"Narrative\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Traceability and Compliance protects evidence integrity and detects drift in requirement-test links.\\n\"},\"Title\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Traceability and Compliance Security\"}}},\"traceability\":{\"kind\":\"object\",\"object\":{\"Narrative\":{\"kind\":\"string\",\"string\":\"Tracea